contentText:
Rue and the other Euphoria kids definitely aren&#8217;t in high school anymore. The trailer for the third season of Sam Levinson&#8217;s hit HBO Max series finally arrived on Wednesday (Jan. 14), showing how Zendaya &#8216;s character and former classmates must contend with the harshness of the real world five years after graduation.

